{"type": "message", "id": "19e6460b", "parentId": "c48a7521", "timestamp": "2026-04-06T20:10:02.395Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_3e2386307d55444da301c95b", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"\\\"MA Media and Communications\\\" Goldsmiths fees 2025 international tuition\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 3,\n  \"tookMs\": 881,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"312bb974c2f9fde1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMA Media & Communications | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"312bb974c2f9fde1\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-media-communications/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"585ac9e66c4527e1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nExplore the Goldsmiths scholarships finder to find out what funding you may be eligible for. Find out about paying your tuition fees.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"585ac9e66c4527e1\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.gold.ac.uk\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b936a57184880187\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMA Media and Communications at Goldsmiths, University of London | You Apply\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b936a57184880187\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://youapply.com/program/ma-media-communications-master-by-course-work-goldsmiths-university-of-london\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"35ab0a119da5a9c5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTo study at Goldsmiths, you will need to demonstrate that you have a good level of written and spoken English. IELTS requirements for each programme can be found on the relevant programme page. The Department has a strong record of employment prospects for its graduates and has established strong links with the creative industries in London and beyond. We have a significant number of international students on the MA Media and Communications, some of whom come to the programme by arrangement with their employer in their home countries, and return to their jobs on completion.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"35ab0a119da5a9c5\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"youapply.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9f0877fa9e7c3e3c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMedia & Communications - Masters Degree at Goldsmiths 10722\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9f0877fa9e7c3e3c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.masterscompare.co.uk/masters-course/media-038-communications/10722\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"263426bd9cee74f3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGoldsmiths offers a range of financial support including postgraduate scholarships, bursaries and fee waivers. These are awarded based on a variety of criteria, for example academic achievements or personal circumstances. Graduates from this degree go into advertising, marketing and public relations, broadcasting and print media, social media, NGOs and intergovernmental organisations as well as the arts and heritage sector.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"263426bd9cee74f3\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.masterscompare.co.uk\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "\"MA Media and Communications\" Goldsmiths fees 2025 international tuition", "provider": "brave", "count": 3, "tookMs": 881, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"312bb974c2f9fde1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA Media & Communications | Goldsmiths, University of London\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"312bb974c2f9fde1\">>>", "url": "https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-media-communications/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"585ac9e66c4527e1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nExplore the Goldsmiths scholarships finder to find out what funding you may be eligible for. Find out about paying your tuition fees.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"585ac9e66c4527e1\">>>", "siteName": "www.gold.ac.uk"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b936a57184880187\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA Media and Communications at Goldsmiths, University of London | You Apply\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b936a57184880187\">>>", "url": "https://youapply.com/program/ma-media-communications-master-by-course-work-goldsmiths-university-of-london", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"35ab0a119da5a9c5\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTo study at Goldsmiths, you will need to demonstrate that you have a good level of written and spoken English. IELTS requirements for each programme can be found on the relevant programme page. The Department has a strong record of employment prospects for its graduates and has established strong links with the creative industries in London and beyond. We have a significant number of international students on the MA Media and Communications, some of whom come to the programme by arrangement with their employer in their home countries, and return to their jobs on completion.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"35ab0a119da5a9c5\">>>", "siteName": "youapply.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9f0877fa9e7c3e3c\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMedia & Communications - Masters Degree at Goldsmiths 10722\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9f0877fa9e7c3e3c\">>>", "url": "https://www.masterscompare.co.uk/masters-course/media-038-communications/10722", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"263426bd9cee74f3\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nGoldsmiths offers a range of financial support including postgraduate scholarships, bursaries and fee waivers. These are awarded based on a variety of criteria, for example academic achievements or personal circumstances. Graduates from this degree go into advertising, marketing and public relations, broadcasting and print media, social media, NGOs and intergovernmental organisations as well as the arts and heritage sector.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"263426bd9cee74f3\">>>", "siteName": "www.masterscompare.co.uk"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775506202394}}
