b Search\\n---\\nMA Media & Communications | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"015da0d6a5a2f877\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-media-communications/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d539a72b536f11b6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nYou will choose optional modules worth 90 credits, at least 60 of which must be from the list offered by the School of Media, Communications and Cultural Studies.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d539a72b536f11b6\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.gold.ac.uk\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"667c4555421ff691\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMedia, Communications and Cultural Studies modules | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"667c4555421ff691\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/media-modules/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"63c48bbc85e124eb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe School offers a wide range of option modules each year, which are taken in addition to the core modules on our Masters programmes.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"63c48bbc85e124eb\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.gold.ac.uk\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"752776e5e7cbf72d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMA Cultural Studies | Goldsmiths, University of London\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"752776e5e7cbf72d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/ma-cultural-studies/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7efbe0171da47021\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOur school has been ranked second in the UK for &#x27;world-leading or internationally excellent&#x27; research (Research Excellence Framework, 2021) and 16th in the world (third in the UK) in the 2024 QS World Rankings for communication 